.*
!.github/
_tmp/
build/
node_modules/
# dist/ is generated (webpack) and NOT tracked. It was committed historically so
# the plugin could be installed by cloning into wp-content/plugins; releases now
# ship a built zip from CI (.github/workflows/release.yml → scripts/package.mjs),
# so the tracked copy only went stale and added rebuild diff noise. Local dev
# installs symlink the repo root, which reads dist/ off disk — run
# `npm ci && npm run start` after a fresh clone to populate it.
dist/
